      "scale": "0 unusable; 5 mixed with substantial friction; 7 good observed experience with meaningful limitations/friction; 10 exceptional and consistently clear. Subjective review of observed emulated sessions, not win-rate grading or hardware certification. Overall is holistic, not arithmetic.",
