      "reasons": {
        "overall_mobile": "Coherent atmosphere, understandable objective chain and usable touch assists, tempered by target acquisition corrections, attention competition and limited continuous-control evidence. Two wins alone do not determine score.",
        "controls": "Two-contact move/fire drag worked; manual swipe and DASH activation observed. Moving target required correction. Physical thumb comfort, continuous holds, zoom and tools not assessed.",
        "gameplay": "Recovery, coil phases and deck defense provide observable progression and threats; route assistance helped travel. Limited manual combat and interruptions constrain challenge/flow assessment.",
        "presentation": "Consistent rain-lit industrial setting and restrained cyan/amber feedback; audio and hardware rendering quality unassessed.",
        "usability": "Map, objective checks, contextual holds, automatic reload and explicit START FRESH supported completion. Label transitions required learning; threats during holds divided attention.",
        "readability": "Large health/ammo and target/coil feedback read clearly; small secondary text, dark scenery and overlapping cues reduced glance clarity."
      }
